abstract: "Computational companion to From target rheology to formulation: benchmarking data-driven models for shear modulus prediction and computational candidate design for multi-component biopolymer hydrogels. Contains curated formulation records, recovered historical Ca/no-ion GP, new-series composition-blocked validation, fitted source-aware GP, preparation Monte Carlo, exploratory MCMC, and untested candidate recipes. The other original historical fitting pipelines and raw rheological fitting inputs are unavailable."
keywords:
  - hydrogel
  - rheology
  - Gaussian process
  - grouped validation
  - Monte Carlo
  - formulation screening
